Note that in this case the shopkeeper was angry but still inside his
shop.  G-mon could have retreated the first time he hit.  I take it the
damage was so high G-mon died on the first hit or G-mon tried trading
blows? G-mon likely did not expect him to be angry at you when he first
entered.

Or it was a story of combat deaths of two monsters in the corridor
leading to the shop.  Maybe the shopkeeper recovered by the time G-mon
arrived in the shop.  Or recovered while G-mon was in the doorway trying
to get in to shop.

I've seen shopkeepers take no damage from wands.  I attributed it to
their 0 armor class.


